48
00:01:45,000 --> 00:01:46,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

49
00:01:47,210 --> 00:01:49,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This isn't good.</font>

50
00:01:50,590 --> 00:01:52,340
