52
00:01:54,510 --> 00:01:55,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Queen Bee...</font>

53
00:02:02,930 --> 00:02:05,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That kind of stuff shouldn't
be effective should it?!</font>

54
00:02:21,660 --> 00:02:22,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Chakra...!</font>

55
00:02:25,370 --> 00:02:26,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

56
00:02:37,840 --> 00:02:40,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's no good... There's no way
I can make it in time!</font>

57
00:02:42,180 --> 00:02:43,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

58
00:02:44,510 --> 00:02:47,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know when to give up!</font>

59
00:02:50,020 --> 00:02:51,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's right...</font>

60
00:02:51,600 --> 00:02:56,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know that Naruto would never give up
no matter what the situation is!</font>

61
00:03:24,180 --> 00:03:26,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, did you catch them?</font>

62
00:03:27,350 --> 00:03:28,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a foolish group!</font>

63
00:03:29,310 --> 00:03:30,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They made this creature mad...</font>

64
00:03:30,940 --> 00:03:33,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And they all got bound in wax!</font>

65
00:03:34,190 --> 00:03:36,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bees make wax.</font>

66
00:03:36,270 --> 00:03:39,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're an insect handler
and you don't know that?</font>

67
00:03:39,860 --> 00:03:43,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He's right!
C'mon are you really an insect handler?</font>

68
00:03:43,990 --> 00:03:45,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What about the Bikochu?</font>

69
00:03:45,740 --> 00:03:46,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nothing.</font>

70
00:03:47,080 --> 00:03:49,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We did an all-out mobilization
and searched</font>

71
00:03:49,660 --> 00:03:50,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but we haven't found it.</font>

72
00:03:51,290 --> 00:03:53,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aren't these guys carrying it?</font>

73
00:03:53,620 --> 00:03:55,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's unthinkable.</font>

74
00:03:56,420 --> 00:03:57,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So that means...</font>

75
00:03:58,130 --> 00:04:01,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So we're going to have to
ask one of these guys after all.</font>

76
00:04:02,130 --> 00:04:03,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Who's gonna talk?!</font>

77
00:04:04,930 --> 00:04:06,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We can tell you.</font>

78
00:04:06,100 --> 00:04:07,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino!</font>

79
00:04:08,180 --> 00:04:11,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However...
It's in exchange for Hinata.</font>

80
00:04:12,440 --> 00:04:14,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's stupid isn't it? To bargain...</font>

81
00:04:16,150 --> 00:04:18,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you not understand your position?</font>

82
00:04:18,400 --> 00:04:21,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You guys definitely will not
find the Bikochu.</font>

83
00:04:25,070 --> 00:04:26,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And you're pressed for time.</font>

84
00:04:27,450 --> 00:04:30,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are the ones... who will regret it.</font>

85
00:04:33,920 --> 00:04:35,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What should we do?</font>

86
00:04:35,080 --> 00:04:36,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If things stay like this</font>

87
00:04:36,380 --> 00:04:38,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the Bikochu won't be of any help
even if it hatches.</font>

88
00:04:39,670 --> 00:04:42,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In that case our mission is also...</font>

89
00:04:43,880 --> 00:04:44,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But...</font>

90
00:04:44,880 --> 00:04:47,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we can get rid of even one
of the Aburame family...</font>

91
00:04:56,190 --> 00:04:57,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata...</font>

92
00:04:58,480 --> 00:04:59,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you worried?</font>

93
00:05:00,110 --> 00:05:01,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Of course!</font>

94
00:05:03,070 --> 00:05:04,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She's strong.</font>

95
00:05:04,780 --> 00:05:05,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

96
00:05:08,070 --> 00:05:11,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Much more... than you think.</font>

97
00:05:16,960 --> 00:05:19,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I concede. We have a deal.</font>

98
00:05:20,090 --> 00:05:22,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">First of all, we need our friend.</font>

99
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened?</font>

100
00:05:47,450 --> 00:05:49,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The brat... isn't here.</font>

101
00:05:50,530 --> 00:05:53,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The wax she was trapped in isn't there....</font>

102
00:05:54,290 --> 00:05:57,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She may have been swept out
to the waterfall.</font>

103
00:05:58,000 --> 00:05:58,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jibachi!</font>

104
00:05:58,920 --> 00:06:04,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped! I warned her not
to make a bad move or she'd die.</font>

105
00:06:04,460 --> 00:06:05,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You!</font>

106
00:06:06,630 --> 00:06:09,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What did you do to Hinata?!</font>

107
00:06:09,760 --> 00:06:12,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened to Hinata! Hey!</font>

108
00:06:13,680 --> 00:06:15,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up kid.</font>

109
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:19,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The kid's probably in
the depths of hell about now.</font>

110
00:06:19,850 --> 00:06:20,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn you!</font>

111
00:06:21,860 --> 00:06:25,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Aha, the girl's your girlfriend?</font>

112
00:06:26,440 --> 00:06:31,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You...! I absolutely will not forgive you!</font>

113
00:06:32,200 --> 00:06:37,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're kidding me.
What can you do looking like that?</font>

114
00:06:37,330 --> 00:06:41,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Without Hinata you'll never get
your hands on the Bikochu either.</font>

115
00:06:43,380 --> 00:06:44,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You are right...</font>

116
00:06:44,800 --> 00:06:47,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That girl's death was not part
of the plan</font>

117
00:06:47,800 --> 00:06:50,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but in the end it's a good thing.</font>

118
00:06:53,050 --> 00:06:57,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because... we'll take your lives in return.</font>

119
00:06:59,060 --> 00:07:01,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From the very beginning people from
the Village Hidden in the Leaves and</font>

120
00:07:01,980 --> 00:07:04,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">from my own Village Hidden in the Stones
have been sworn enemies.</font>

121
00:07:05,480 --> 00:07:07,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's natural that we kill
each other, isn't it?</font>

122
00:07:13,570 --> 00:07:15,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What're ya gonna do, little guy?</font>

123
00:07:15,620 --> 00:07:17,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Die like this?</font>

124
00:07:17,660 --> 00:07:24,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or if you tell me where the Bikochu is
I could save you for now.</font>

125
00:07:30,260 --> 00:07:33,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— All right.
— Don't you dare tell them!</font>

126
00:07:34,510 --> 00:07:38,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those jerks,
I'm going to blow them away!</font>

127
00:07:41,020 --> 00:07:43,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up brat!</font>

128
00:07:57,950 --> 00:07:59,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Jibachi?
— Hey!</font>

129
00:08:00,620 --> 00:08:03,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up, I've got to kill him!</font>

130
00:08:11,670 --> 00:08:12,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's a Paper Bomb!</font>

131
00:08:28,980 --> 00:08:30,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're...!</font>

132
00:08:33,240 --> 00:08:34,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-You're...!</font>

133
00:08:34,910 --> 00:08:36,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">...still alive!</font>

134
00:08:53,340 --> 00:08:58,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That was really close.
But I didn't give up just like Naruto...</font>

135
00:09:00,470 --> 00:09:03,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Did she escape from the wax?
It can't be!</font>

136
00:09:03,850 --> 00:09:05,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These are not ordinary kids.</font>

137
00:09:11,150 --> 00:09:12,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Leave it to me!</font>

138
00:09:12,570 --> 00:09:13,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

139
00:09:15,150 --> 00:09:18,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've never used that in an actual fight...</font>

140
00:09:19,280 --> 00:09:21,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But I have to do it here now!</font>

141
00:09:23,120 --> 00:09:24,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bee Bombs Jutsu!</font>

142
00:09:25,660 --> 00:09:27,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">1000 Bee Stingers Jutsu!</font>

143
00:09:27,920 --> 00:09:29,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Bee Swarm Jutsu!</font>

144
00:09:36,430 --> 00:09:37,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

145
00:09:38,890 --> 00:09:41,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... Watch me.</font>

146
00:09:49,810 --> 00:09:52,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Protective 8 Trigrams 64 palms!</font>

147
00:09:55,610 --> 00:09:56,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— What?!
— What?!</font>

148
00:10:06,080 --> 00:10:07,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're kidding, right?</font>

149
00:10:07,710 --> 00:10:10,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Hinata can do
such an amazing Jutsu?</font>

150
00:10:11,000 --> 00:10:14,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Hinata that you know Naruto
is from when?</font>

151
00:10:14,170 --> 00:10:15,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean?</font>

152
00:10:16,590 --> 00:10:20,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You've learned new Jutsu
since the Chunin Ninja Exam, haven't you?</font>

153
00:10:21,640 --> 00:10:24,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata has been steadily developing too.</font>

154
00:10:27,430 --> 00:10:30,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She always has been concerned...</font>

155
00:10:34,530 --> 00:10:35,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take aim.</font>

156
00:10:39,910 --> 00:10:42,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's nice the three of you</font>

157
00:10:42,740 --> 00:10:45,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">all have something you're good at
and something you like.</font>

158
00:10:46,040 --> 00:10:47,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata, you should find something too...</font>

159
00:10:49,370 --> 00:10:50,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're right.</font>

160
00:10:50,790 --> 00:10:52,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">By the way what is it?</font>

161
00:10:54,250 --> 00:10:55,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You had some business with me,
didn't you?</font>

162
00:10:58,630 --> 00:10:59,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah...</font>

163
00:11:01,470 --> 00:11:04,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want you to join me
in my training.</font>

164
00:11:05,680 --> 00:11:10,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata was fretting over
what she could do...</font>

165
00:11:10,810 --> 00:11:12,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What she should do...</font>

166
00:11:21,410 --> 00:11:22,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

167
00:11:22,870 --> 00:11:24,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, I don't think that we should...</font>

168
00:11:24,120 --> 00:11:26,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No... Don't go easy on me!</font>

169
00:11:29,540 --> 00:11:31,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If you're doing it for me...</font>

170
00:11:33,040 --> 00:11:34,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do it seriously!</font>

171
00:11:36,050 --> 00:11:37,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've got it!</font>

172
00:11:44,970 --> 00:11:46,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">During the harsh training</font>

173
00:11:48,140 --> 00:11:52,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata discovered her own styles...
and her own special Jutsu.</font>

174
00:11:54,560 --> 00:11:57,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the result of her training.</font>

175
00:12:01,610 --> 00:12:06,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? You why!?</font>

176
00:12:06,990 --> 00:12:08,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll tell you something...</font>

177
00:12:08,540 --> 00:12:12,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Angering the Queen Bee
getting encased in wax</font>

178
00:12:12,540 --> 00:12:14,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it was all part of the strategy.</font>

179
00:12:15,710 --> 00:12:18,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">With our Chakra being sucked
and being immobilized</font>

180
00:12:18,880 --> 00:12:22,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it was the only way to protect ourselves
from the larvae...</font>

181
00:12:25,180 --> 00:12:30,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And do you think I was doing nothing
while I was captured?</font>

182
00:12:31,770 --> 00:12:36,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I was ordering my bugs.
The wax we're wrapped in is very weak.</font>

183
00:12:44,780 --> 00:12:45,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino!</font>

184
00:12:46,990 --> 00:12:48,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because of her hard training</font>

185
00:12:48,580 --> 00:12:52,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata's Chakra control
has dramatically improved.</font>

186
00:12:53,540 --> 00:12:56,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Jutsu is what she developed
from the training...</font>

187
00:12:57,420 --> 00:12:59,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Protective 8 trigrams 64 palms!</font>

188
00:13:01,710 --> 00:13:07,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata's already flexible body combined
with fine-tuned Chakra control</font>

189
00:13:09,470 --> 00:13:12,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">could completely defend
an attack from every direction...</font>

190
00:13:14,350 --> 00:13:16,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Truly it's an ultimate defense Jutsu.</font>

191
00:13:18,440 --> 00:13:20,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yet it's different from
Neji's 8 Trigrams Palms Rotation.</font>

192
00:13:20,900 --> 00:13:22,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's Hinata's own Jutsu...</font>

193
00:13:22,940 --> 00:13:26,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She finally worked that out on her own.</font>

194
00:13:28,200 --> 00:13:31,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">She probably did it because she wanted
to be acknowledged by her father.</font>

195
00:13:33,160 --> 00:13:35,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To be acknowledged by everyone...</font>

196
00:13:39,500 --> 00:13:42,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And to be acknowledged by you.</font>

197
00:13:53,270 --> 00:13:55,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Our Jutsu isn't effective at all?!</font>

198
00:13:55,770 --> 00:13:57,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What the hell is going on?</font>

199
00:13:57,640 --> 00:13:59,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What a girl!</font>

200
00:14:00,440 --> 00:14:02,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, what happened to those guys?!</font>

201
00:14:02,110 --> 00:14:03,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">When did they?!</font>

202
00:14:08,360 --> 00:14:09,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Summoning Jutsu!</font>

203
00:14:16,750 --> 00:14:18,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Blow them away!</font>

204
00:14:32,300 --> 00:14:33,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

205
00:14:34,390 --> 00:14:35,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shino!</font>

206
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:40,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Believe... in her.</font>

207
00:14:45,570 --> 00:14:46,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Make the Chakra...</font>

208
00:14:48,900 --> 00:14:51,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">sharper, stronger...</font>

209
00:14:52,030 --> 00:14:54,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">bigger, more flexible...</font>

210
00:14:56,080 --> 00:15:02,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">more... more... more...
more... more... more... more!</font>

211
00:15:17,390 --> 00:15:18,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

212
00:15:19,980 --> 00:15:20,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata!</font>

213
00:15:23,900 --> 00:15:25,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

214
00:15:26,900 --> 00:15:32,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata, that's an awesome Jutsu!
You're really awesome!</font>

215
00:15:34,740 --> 00:15:35,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...!</font>

216
00:15:39,460 --> 00:15:42,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's hurry. It'll be dawn soon.</font>

217
00:15:42,420 --> 00:15:43,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Okay!
— Yeah!</font>

218
00:15:57,760 --> 00:15:59,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's becoming a pupa already?</font>

219
00:15:59,930 --> 00:16:03,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If we make it smell Sasuke's scent
at the moment it hatches</font>

220
00:16:03,730 --> 00:16:05,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the mission is complete.</font>

221
00:16:05,520 --> 00:16:06,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right!</font>

222
00:16:09,780 --> 00:16:12,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke... Wait for me!</font>

223
00:16:14,030 --> 00:16:14,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

224
00:16:16,450 --> 00:16:17,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inside the tree, huh.</font>

225
00:16:18,370 --> 00:16:22,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If it was there
the bees should have found it...</font>

226
00:16:22,080 --> 00:16:23,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can still move?</font>

227
00:16:25,000 --> 00:16:30,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This insect cage was coated
with secret Aburame family insect repellent.</font>

228
00:16:30,710 --> 00:16:31,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-What?</font>

229
00:16:32,670 --> 00:16:36,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The bees won't come close
because of the repellent.</font>

230
00:16:36,850 --> 00:16:41,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As long as you're using bees to search...
you definitely won't find it.</font>

231
00:16:46,270 --> 00:16:47,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I expected as much.</font>

232
00:16:48,190 --> 00:16:50,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think as long as your clan exists...</font>

233
00:16:50,400 --> 00:16:55,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">my clan maybe destined to
be ruined some day.</font>

234
00:16:59,080 --> 00:17:00,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But!</font>

235
00:17:04,330 --> 00:17:08,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I absolutely will not let you
succeed at your mission!</font>

236
00:17:09,210 --> 00:17:12,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if it kills me, that Bikochu...</font>

237
00:17:13,720 --> 00:17:15,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

238
00:17:17,140 --> 00:17:22,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is our hope...
in order to get our friend back!</font>

239
00:17:22,720 --> 00:17:24,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I won't let you do that!</font>

240
00:17:24,600 --> 00:17:26,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

241
00:17:29,570 --> 00:17:30,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Rasengan!</font>

242
00:17:44,830 --> 00:17:46,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey look...</font>

243
00:17:49,840 --> 00:17:50,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The pupa is hatching!</font>

244
00:17:50,880 --> 00:17:52,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay!</font>

245
00:17:52,750 --> 00:17:54,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? It's gone!</font>

246
00:17:54,880 --> 00:17:56,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You had it 'til just a minute ago!</font>

247
00:17:57,180 --> 00:17:58,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, search for it hurry!</font>

248
00:17:58,840 --> 00:17:59,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">R-Right...</font>

249
00:18:02,310 --> 00:18:03,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

250
00:18:05,270 --> 00:18:07,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Over there.</font>

251
00:18:11,110 --> 00:18:13,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You blew it away the instant you set off
the Rasengan!</font>

252
00:18:13,980 --> 00:18:14,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hurry!</font>

253
00:18:14,900 --> 00:18:16,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I know!</font>

254
00:18:17,240 --> 00:18:18,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C'mon, c'mon.</font>

255
00:18:21,200 --> 00:18:22,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's going to hatch!</font>

256
00:18:39,220 --> 00:18:41,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We did it! Hurry make it sniff this...</font>

257
00:18:55,070 --> 00:18:58,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Wh-Why...?!</font>

258
00:18:58,110 --> 00:19:01,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That thing just now doesn't count!
C'mon sniff Sasuke's smell!</font>

259
00:19:02,030 --> 00:19:03,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— It's all over now.
— Huh...?</font>

260
00:19:09,670 --> 00:19:12,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Stop! Wait!</font>

261
00:19:14,290 --> 00:19:16,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So you failed because you farted!</font>

262
00:19:17,170 --> 00:19:18,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take responsibility!</font>

263
00:19:18,720 --> 00:19:21,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are you saying that for?!</font>

264
00:19:28,390 --> 00:19:29,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then...</font>

265
00:19:32,270 --> 00:19:35,690
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's... the Bikochu isn't it?</font>

266
00:19:39,570 --> 00:19:42,910
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto... I found you!</font>

267
00:19:47,410 --> 00:19:49,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">C'mon forgive me already, Sakura!</font>

268
00:19:50,040 --> 00:19:52,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No! I absolutely will not forgive you!</font>

269
00:19:52,710 --> 00:19:56,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Sakura, you look so scary!
— Come back here!</font>

270
00:19:56,750 --> 00:19:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So the mission failed...</font>

271
00:19:59,130 --> 00:20:02,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that they succeeded
at protecting the Bikochu</font>

272
00:20:02,180 --> 00:20:06,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but failed at getting it to smell
the scent of Uchiha Sasuke.</font>

273
00:20:06,300 --> 00:20:09,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see... Hinata must be depressed.</font>

274
00:20:10,270 --> 00:20:13,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This strategy was her idea, wasn't it?</font>

275
00:20:14,270 --> 00:20:17,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well... Looks like that's not the case.</font>

276
00:20:19,860 --> 00:20:24,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hinata... I heard that your mission failed.</font>

277
00:20:24,820 --> 00:20:27,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes. It didn't work at all.</font>

278
00:20:28,200 --> 00:20:31,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have to train more and more...
and work harder next time!</font>

279
00:20:32,330 --> 00:20:34,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I-I see... Good luck.</font>

280
00:20:48,560 --> 00:20:49,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More...</font>

281
00:20:51,810 --> 00:20:52,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More...</font>

282
00:20:53,940 --> 00:20:54,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More...</font>

283
00:20:56,770 --> 00:20:57,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More!</font>

284
00:21:15,550 --> 00:21:19,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">kusottare na nyuusu ga toori sugite</font></b></font></font></font>

285
00:21:15,550 --> 00:21:19,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">crappy news pass us by</font></b></font></font></font>

286
00:21:19,840 --> 00:21:22,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">kimi wa kotoba wo nakusu</font></b></font></font></font>

287
00:21:19,840 --> 00:21:22,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">and you become speechless</font></b></font></font></font>

288
00:21:24,810 --> 00:21:29,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">boku no koe ja marude chiisa sugite</font></b></font></font></font>

289
00:21:24,810 --> 00:21:29,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">my voice is way too soft</font></b></font></font></font>

290
00:21:29,270 --> 00:21:31,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">kimi wa henji mo shinai</font></b></font></font></font>

291
00:21:29,270 --> 00:21:31,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="23"><font face="Segoe UI"><b><font color="#cdfbff">so you don't answer</font></b></font></font></font>

